flowchart TD
    A[User opens app] --> B[Main screen - any floor]
    B --> C[Club Chat overlay appears as floating button]
    C -->|Click| D[Open Global Chat Overlay]
    D --> E[View messages from all floors in real-time]
    E --> F{User membership level}

    F -->|Gold| G[See Diamond chat as dimmed/faded]
    G --> G1[Read-only - no typing]
    G1 --> E

    F -->|High-tier member| H[See all chats at full brightness]
    H --> I[Can type in any floor chat]
    I --> J[Send message]
    J --> K{Rate limit check: Max 5 msgs / 20 secs?}
    K -->|Exceeded| K1[Block send - show cooldown countdown]
    K1 --> I
    K -->|OK| L[AI Moderator - silent scan]
    L --> L1{Club Manager AI + Floor AI review}
    L1 -->|Clean| M[Message broadcasts to all floors with floor tag + badge]
    L1 -->|Flagged| N[AI intervention: warn, mute, or remove]
    N --> E

    M --> O[Engagement boost: XP + heat increase]
    O --> P{Badge threshold met?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Earn collectible badge - added to inventory]
    Q --> E
    P -->|No| E

    D --> R[User sees sender avatar]
    R --> S{User action}
    S -->|Report| T[Submit report - queued for AI + human review]
    S -->|Block| U[Block user - hide messages instantly]
    T --> V[Mod action: warn, suspend, or remove]
    U --> E
